    "text": "The Foreign Exchange (Classes of Capital Transactions Undertaken in Sri Lanka by a Person Resident Outside Sri Lanka) Regulations No. 2 of 2021 published in the Gazette Extraordinary Notification No. 2213/35 dated 03 February 2021, as amended, issued under the Foreign Exchange Act, No. 12 of 2017 (the Regulations), are hereby further amended as follows:-",
